==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP|US}} {{IPA|/ˈsteɪ.pl/}}, {{SAMPA|/"steI.pl/}}
* {{rhymes|eɪpəl}}

===Etymology 1===
{{etyl|enm}} from {{etyl|dum|-}} ''[[stapel]]'' or {{etyl|fro}} ''[[estaple]]'', of {{etyl|gem}} origin, from {{etyl|gml}} ''[[stapol]]'' or {{etyl|dum}} ''[[stapel]]''. Akin to {{etyl|ang|-}} ''[[stapol]]'' "market, court"

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# A [[basic]] or [[essential]] [[supply]].
# A basic [[food]].
#: ''Rice is a '''staple''' in the diet of many cultures.''
# A recurring topic or character

